        "First-time onboarding: show clickable starter prompts until the user submits their first prompt ever (persisted in settings). Freebuff only.",
        "Retire onboarding suggested prompts once the user submits anything (typed or clicked), persisting so they don't return on future launches.",
        "Show first-time onboarding starter prompts only on a pristine, idle, empty-input default-mode chat, and never while a menu/overlay is up.",
